# Build artifacts. kshot and kshot.desktop are GENERATED and must never be
# committed: kshot.desktop is produced from kshot.desktop.in with PREFIX baked
# into Exec=, so a committed copy carries one machine's PREFIX and silently
# overrides everyone else's. That shipped a broken AUR package once already --
# binary at /usr/bin/kshot, desktop file claiming /usr/local/bin/kshot, and KWin
# denying every capture with NoAuthorized.
kshot
kshot.desktop
moc_*.cpp
*.o
*.so
pkg/
src-pkg/
*.pkg.tar.zst
